  "sot23_5_pinout_matrix": {
    "comparison_summary": "All three SOT-23-5 single op-amps in the pilot batch (TLV9061IDBVR, TLV9001IDBVR, OPA333AIDBVR) share TI's standard DBV SOT-23-5 Top View pinout (1=OUT, 2=V-, 3=IN+, 4=IN-, 5=V+), verified directly on 300 DPI PNG diagrams. However, ALL THREE datasheets document an inverted/permuted 5-pin layout in SC70 (DCK) or alternate SOT-23-5 'U' suffix (TLV9001UIDBVR) where pins 1, 3, and 4 are swapped (1=IN+, 2=V-, 3=IN-, 4=OUT, 5=V+). Furthermore, despite matching DBV pinouts, the three OPNs span 30x bandwidth and 10x drive-current extremes (OPA333: 0.35 MHz / ±5 mA / 17 µA vs TLV9001: 1 MHz / ±40 mA / 60 µA vs TLV9061: 10 MHz / ±50 mA / 538 µA).",
