    "lm393dr_device_kind": "comparator",
    "lm393dr_output_type": "open-collector",
    "lm393dr_prop_delay_ns": 1300,
    "hazard_summary": "Despite sharing an identical 8-pin SOIC pinout (verified on LM358 page 3 Fig 4-1 and LM393 page 3 Fig 4-1), LM358DR and LM393DR are functionally incompatible. Populating LM393DR on an LM358/LMV358 board leaves high outputs floating (missing external pull-up resistor) and causes severe oscillation in linear negative feedback because LM393 lacks internal Miller compensation. Conversely, running LM358DR as a comparator produces slow slew-limited edges (0.3 V/µs) and Class-B crossover artifacts."
  },
